; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 07. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'it15_lily'
it15_lily.dialogstring_04E3D5! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: This is my village.[N]Surprised there aren't[N]any houses?[WAI][N]Will, play the melody[N]that called me to you in[N]Edward Castle's basement.[END]`
it15_lily.dialogstring_04E440! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Will. Where are you[N]going? Play the melody[N]here…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_038CA0! `[CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]The melody rode on the[N]wind and was spread[N]throughout the prairie.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_lily'
it15_lily.dialogstring_04E46F! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Surprised?[WAI][N]Normally people can't see[N]Itory because a barrier[N]hides the village.[WAI][N]Anyway, the little lady[N]had a rough trip, huh?[WAI][N]I thought I'd go crazy[N]hearing "my feet hurt"[N]and "I'm thirsty" all the[N]way up the mountain.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_kara'
it15_kara.dialogstring_04E124! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I can't help that.[N]After all, my feet really[N]were hurting.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Well, I think[N]that's okay. Anyway,[N]please come with me. I'll[N]guide you to my house.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it16_song_woman'
it16_song_woman.dialogstring_04DF96! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme18]The Incans who once lived[N]on this land had no[N]written language.[WAI][N]Their legends were passed[N]down in song.[WAI][N]Even the simplest melody[N]may carry a meaning its[N]listener has forgotten.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_friendly_woman'
it15_friendly_woman.dialogstring_04E033! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme18]There aren't any children[N]around Lilly's age in[N]this village.[FIN]Please be good friends[N]with her, alright?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_lola'
it15_lola.dialogstring_04F11E! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Lola: Will! Will![N]This way![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Bill: So you were safe;[N]good, good[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Lola: We saw some very[N]frightening things![WAI][N]Jackal came with a whole[N]troop of soldiers[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Bill: We were almost[N]killed![END]`
it15_lola.dialogstring_04F1BA! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Lola: Bill, oh my…[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]I upset the soldiers'[N]stomachs with my poison[N]apple pie.[FIN]We barely escaped in that[N]moment.[END]`
it15_lola.dialogstring_04F210! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Lola: Oh, that's right.[N]Lilly, thank you for[N]helping us.[WAI][N]Come inside with Princess[N]Kara.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_lily'
it15_lily.dialogstring_04E53C! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Well then, follow[N]me if you'd like.[WAI][N]Will, this house is mine.[N]If you want to look around[N]the village first, that's[N]fine too.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_kara'
it15_kara.dialogstring_04E175! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Wait, Lilly.[N]I'll go too.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it18_warning_man'
it18_warning_man.dialogstring_04DDC7! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme18]Many people come to this[N]land searching for Incan[N]gold.[WAI][N]But those who enter the[N]Incan ruins often never[N]return[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'it18_warning_woman'
it18_warning_woman.dialogstring_04DE81! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme18]Those ruins are the grave[N]of an ancient people.[N]Shouldn't we leave them[N]in peace[AD]?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_fable_man'
it15_fable_man.dialogstring_04DEC9! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme18]They say that when the old[N]world was falling into[N]ruin, a messenger[N]appeared.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_fable_woman'
it15_fable_woman.dialogstring_04DF22! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,D][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme18]Back then, disease,[N]famine, and mysterious[N]disappearances were[N]spreading through towns[WAI][N]around the world[AD][N]I hope this planet knows[N]peace forever.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sE6_gaia'
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08DF80! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Some walls are weaker than[N]they appear. Thy Psycho[N]Dash can break them.[FIN]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08EB68! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][DLY:5]Became able to use the[N]Power of Darkness,[N][ADR:&AbilityNameTable,AAC]![PAU:50][FIN]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08EB85! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia][DLY:2][ADR:&AbilityDescriptionTable,AAC][END]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08EBDF! `The Psycho Dash is a power[N]that only Will, the young[N]boy, can use.[FIN]With a body check attack[N]thou canst easily crush[N]things like obstacles and[N]destructible walls.[FIN]Thou shouldst charge up[N]using the attack button…`

?INCLUDE 'it15_running_man'
it15_running_man.dialogstring_04DE32! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme18]Try running down that hill[N]over there. You'll[N]definitely be surprised.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it17_kara'
it17_kara.dialogstring_04E1F6! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: It's a charming[N]village, right? The wind[N]feels nice and[N]refreshing…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it17_lily'
it17_lily.dialogstring_04E62C! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: The Elder is in[N]the flower field.[WAI][N]I don't know how old he[N]is, but he's very wise.[WAI][N]Want to go see him?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_lola'
it15_lola.dialogstring_04F249! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Lola: Somehow I had an[N]unpleasant hunch.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_bill'
it15_bill.dialogstring_04EFAE! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Bill: Go on. The Elder[N]knows more than anyone[N]around here.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it19_inca_statue_a'
it19_inca_statue_a.dialogstring_04F38D! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:0][DLY:9]You've found[N]Incan Statue A.[PAU:A0][CLD]`
it19_inca_statue_a.dialogstring_04F3A8! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]You've found Incan [N]Statue A! But your [N]inventory is full! [END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_elder'
it15_elder.dialogstring_04E9FF! `[DEF]Will hears a feeble voice[N]behind him[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Mysterious voice: It was[N]good that you came, Will[AD][END]`
it15_elder.dialogstring_04EA45! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Elder: Here. I'm among[N]the flowers.[WAI][N]I've prolonged my life[N]far beyond its proper[N]span.[WAI][N]Do not mistake a life[N]without end for a life[N]without burden.[END]`
it15_elder.dialogstring_04EA77! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Elder: If the flower[N]fairies aren't giving me[N]their protection like[N]this, I won't be able to[N]survive.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]While we're talking, you[N]look so much like your[N]parents.[FIN]It seems like yesterday[N]that your father came to[N]our village.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: My dad came to your…[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Elder: Your mother…[N]Putting in briefly.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Shira, your grandparents[N]Bill and Lola's daughter,[N]was an extremely beautiful[N]woman.[FIN]Your father fell in love[N]at first sight and stole[N]her from this village.[FIN]Everyone in the Itory clan[N]holds a mysterious power,[N]but Shira's was grander[N]than any other.[FIN]She even erected the[N]barrier that renders this[N]village invisible from the[N]outside.[FIN]But your father came[N]inside very easily.[FIN]When I think about it,[N]that man was also a[N]mysterious human being…[FIN]`
it15_elder.dialogstring_04EC46! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]That being said, were you[N]summoned by your father?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No[PAL:4]`
it15_elder.dialogstring_04EC76! `[CLR]Elder: What? You weren't[N]summoned by him?[FIN]Then perhaps we've[N]misunderstood the signs[AD][END]`
it15_elder.dialogstring_04ECAB! `[CLR]Elder: I understand[AD][N]Then Lola's hunch was[N]right after all.[END]`
it15_elder.dialogstring_04ECCB! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]So, do you intend to go?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No[PAL:4]`
it15_elder.dialogstring_04ECEC! `[CLR]Elder: What? You're not[N]nearly as bold as your[N]father was.[END]`
it15_elder.dialogstring_04ED19! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Elder: Very well. In that[N]case, I will entrust you[N]with the Incan idol that[N]is handed down in this[N]village.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]The two idols will be the[N]key to unravel the[N]mysteries of the Inca…[FIN]They have passed through[N]human hands for many[N]hundreds of years.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]One idol is enshrined in[N]the cave below. Muster up[N]your wisdom and you may[N]take it.[END]`
it15_elder.dialogstring_04EDF4! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Elder: Oh…! That's[N]definitely the Incan idol![N]Wonderful; you've[N]discovered it![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]I think you might have[N]been born to discover the[N]mysteries of the Inca…[FIN]Anyway, I'll teach you a[N]legend that is handed down[N]in this village.[FIN][::][BOR:6][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]At the "Cliff of Laraiˮ,[N]underground beneath the[N]ruin.[FIN]Offer the Incan idols[N]where the breath of the[N]gods does not reach.[FIN]The valley wind will guide[N]you to the location of the[N]golden ship.[FIN]Did you understand that?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No[PAL:4]`
it15_elder.dialogstring_04EF1C! `[JMP:&dialogstring_04EDF4+M]`
it15_elder.dialogstring_04EF23! `[CLR]Elder: It is said that[N]one more idol is held by[N]the Moon Tribe.[WAI][N]Lilly will show you the[N]way there. Be careful.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_lola'
it15_lola.dialogstring_04F277! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Lola: There's an old[N]legend in this village.[WAI][N]When the great comet[N]returns, the ancient[N]powers will stir.[WAI][N]Where light and darkness[N]once divided the world,[N]an old choice will rise[N]again.[WAI][N]Those words have been[N]passed down through the[N]Itory clan for ages.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it15_bill'
it15_bill.dialogstring_04EFDF! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Bill: Was the Elder doing[N]well?[WAI][N]By the way, while you were[N]fighting beneath Edward[N]Castle, did you gather any[N]shining silver spheres?[WAI][N]They seem to hold a[N]strange power.[WAI][N]Echoes and rebirth; your[N]father saw it too[AD][WAI][N]Didn't come from my side![END]`

?INCLUDE 'it17_lily'
it17_lily.dialogstring_04E6E6! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Huh? The Race of[N]the Moon?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Yeah, I know them. They're[N]mysterious lifeforms that[N]better resemble shadows[N]rather than a race.[FIN]They dwell on the summit[N]of a tall, tall mountain[N]nearby, but…[FIN]…do you want to try[N]going there?[N][PAL:0] Yeah, I want to go[N] Actually, nevermind[PAL:4]`
it17_lily.dialogstring_04E78B! `[CLR]Lilly: Maybe that's for[N]the best.[WAI][N]They say people who anger[N]them don't come back.[END]`
it17_lily.dialogstring_04E778! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: I understand.[N]Well, I'll guide you.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it17_kara'
it17_kara.dialogstring_04E223! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I'm going too![N]I want to see the Moon[N]Tribe for myself.[WAI][N]I want to experience the[N]world with my own eyes[N]and ears.[WAI][N]I didn't escape the castle[N]just to sit somewhere[N]safe.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'it17_lily'
it17_lily.dialogstring_04E7C9! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: You can't[AD]![N]It's too dangerous for a[N]little lady like you.[WAI][N]If you don't want to[N]worry Will, wait here[N]like a good girl.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Hmph[AD] Why[AD][N]I'm the only one being[N]left out.[WAI][N]I'll talk to Mrs. Lola,[N]so it's okay![N]It's fiiiine[AD]!![END]`
it17_lily.dialogstring_04E869! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Oh no. She's pouting[AD])[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: A little waiting[N]won't hurt Her Highness.[WAI][N]Alright. The mountain[N]road is rough, but[N]we'll manage.[FIN][CLD][DEF]Will and Lilly head for[N]the summit where the Moon[N]Tribe lives.[END]`
